# Intentionally empty of an SPA catch-all.
#
# Every real route is prerendered to its own dist/<Route>/index.html by
# scripts/prerender.mjs, so unmatched URLs fall through to Netlify's
# auto-served dist/404.html with a real HTTP 404 — instead of the old
# `/* /index.html 200`, which answered every typo with the home page.
#
# Redirect rules live in netlify.toml so they sit next to the headers.
